WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.866
2231. Beneath the surface of the Vesper, a signal.

00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:09.474
You are Ilya Sorel.

00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:12.440
No weapon. A debugger.

00:00:15.818 --> 00:00:17.182
Every Guardian has a flaw.

00:00:20.945 --> 00:00:21.999
But they learn.

00:00:27.055 --> 00:00:27.999
Read their code.

00:00:29.455 --> 00:00:30.719
One line is enough.

00:00:35.236 --> 00:00:36.262
Or become one of them.

00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:45.201
All the way to the heart of the Vesper.

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:55.120
Vesper Protocol. Free demo, on PC.

00:00:55.364 --> 00:00:56.566
Link in the description.
